Package: nbasim
Title: League-Average NBA Possession Simulator
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "you@example.com")
Description: Monte Carlo simulation of NBA games at the possession level. A chain of small
    models (timeout, possession outcome, possession duration) fit to 2016-17 through 2025-26
    play-by-play drives a simulator that plays full games, finishes games from any game state,
    simulates the next possession, and returns play-by-play.
